=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# play sub-menu/01-user ----------------------------------------$
$
# [i] Note$
# Play mode: hardn's own screens and prompts, on the gallery's$
# fixture plans. Nothing on this machine changes: the simulated$
# system only records each step it would apply, and the record$
# is shown when play ends.$
$
# User Management ##############################################$
$
  [+] Non-root             Configured UID >= 1000$
$
# User Configuration -------------------------------------------$
$
  [george]$
$
  [ ] Sudo                 Enabled, No password$
   -  SSH Keys             7 keys$
   -  UID:GID              1000:1000$
   -  Directory            /home/george$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Manage User          Configure sudo, SSH keys$
   2) Create User          Configure a new user$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-2, b or q]: 2$
$
# Create User ##################################################$
$
   1. Username [0, b or q]: alice$
$
   2. Grant sudo privilege? [y/N, 0, b or q]: $
$
# simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# [i] Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

